  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Level_Up/BH_SLLU_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"329\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Level_Up/BH_SLLU_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">進入一個地下城撕裂現實、怪獸威脅人類存亡，而變為最強的力量就在你手中的世界。《Solo Leveling: Level Up!》將 Minecraft 轉化為沉浸式的狩獵體驗，你的從弱到強之旅與人類最強獵人的經典成長軌跡相呼應。此外，你將能夠挑戰所謂的「<strong>門（Gates）</strong>」。門分為不同等級（<strong>E</strong>-<strong>D</strong>-<strong>C</strong>-<strong>B</strong>-<strong>A</strong>-<strong>S</strong>）。隨著你挑戰更高階的門，你將會遇到更強大的怪獸和更豐厚的戰利品。歡迎來到「Solo Leveling: Level Up!」。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f90\">FORGE</span> <span style=\"color:#f00\">1.20.1</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#999\">NEO<span style=\"color:#f90\">FORGE <span style=\"color:#f00\">1.20.4</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">全新《Solo Leveling》模組包已推出（<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Solo Leveling - Reawakening</strong></span>）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快去遊玩吧！點擊此連結 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-reawakening\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-reawakening</a> 以前往全新《Solo Leveling》模組包的專屬頁面！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">全新《Solo Leveling》模組包已推出（<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Solo Leveling - Shadows</strong></span>）！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快去遊玩吧！點擊此連結 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-shadows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-shadows</a> 以前往全新《Solo Leveling》模組包的專屬頁面！</span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Level_Up/BH_SLLU_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>升級</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>技能點數</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>技能樹</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>門</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>門的難度：(E-D-C-B-A-S)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>頭目</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>魔力水晶</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>使用魔力水晶購買裝備的市場</strong></span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>以及更多...</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Shadows/MP_SoloLevelingShadows_other.webp\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-reawakening\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011405/description_2f413ee7-0253-47ee-a8f0-39fb73991d5c.png\" alt=\"點擊此處前往專案頁面！\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/solo-leveling-overload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011405/description_4ef587a5-e9da-433c-a635-b230e6f5588c.png\" alt=\"點擊此處前往專案頁面！\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011405/description_b61817e5-bdf6-4054-a86a-6b741e3bad93.png\" alt=\"點擊此處前往專案頁面！\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><em>點擊您偏好的圖片以開啟模組包專案瀏覽頁面</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Level_Up/BH_SLLU_website.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我是一位熱愛自訂模組包的 Minecraft 玩家。在我的網站，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprofake.netlify.app%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://profake.netlify.app/</a>，您可以找到一系列我精心設計的模組包，旨在提升您的 Minecraft 冒險體驗。無論是動漫主題模組包還是完全由我原創的模組包，總有一款適合您。下載我的模組包，今天就開始探索吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Solo_Leveling_Level_Up/BH_SLLU_banner3.webp\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">點擊&nbsp;<strong>SPOILER</strong>&nbsp;按鈕即可找到我所有的社群連結，衷心感謝所有訪客並訂閱我的社群！&hearts;️</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ghNhPG3rX6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/ghNhPG3rX6</a></p>\n<p>YouTube: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PRO_FAKE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@PRO_FAKE</a></p>\n<p>TikTok: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540pro__fake\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.tiktok.com/@pro<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">fake</span></a></p>\n<p>Instagram: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fpro__fake%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.instagram.com/pro__fake/</a></p>\n<p>Website: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprofake.netlify.app%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://profake.netlify.app/</a></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisec